tegory":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":145.82,"default_fair_val":145.82,"premium_pct":-7.6,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":23.4,"pe_forward":20.6,"pb_trailing":2.8,"pb_forward":2.5,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":3,"fcf_to_ev":7.61,"fcf_to_mcap":8.23,"liab_to_assets":71.7,"cash_to_assets":18.9,"current_ratio":1.78,"roe":12,"roa":3.2,"moat":{"ticker":"SANM","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Sanmina 在電子製造服務 (EMS) 領域的品牌定價能力相對有限。雖然公司在複雜產品製造方面享有聲譽，但其客戶群主要是尋求成本效益和可靠供應鏈的科技公司，而非依賴強勢品牌溢價。與消費品牌不同，EMS 業務的競爭主要體現在效率、質量和交期上，而非品牌忠誠度。因此，其定價權受到市場競爭和客戶議價能力的制約，難以形成顯著的價格壁壘。","comment_en":"Sanmina's brand pricing power in the Electronic Manufacturing Services (EMS) sector is relatively limited. While the company has a reputation for manufacturing complex products, its customer base primarily consists of technology companies seeking cost-effectiveness and reliable supply chains, rather than relying on strong brand premiums. Unlike consumer brands, competition in the EMS business is mainly reflected in efficiency, quality, and delivery times, rather than brand loyalty. Therefore, its pricing power is constrained by market competition and customer bargaining power, making it difficult to form a significant pricing barrier."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"Sanmina 的業務模式不依賴於專利或特許經營權來建立護城河。作為一家 EMS 公司，其核心競爭力在於製造流程的效率、質量控制和供應鏈管理，而非獨特的技術或受監管的市場准入。雖然公司可能擁有某些製程上的改良或專利，但這些通常難以構成持久的、可觀的競爭壁壘，因為技術迭代快且易被模仿。監管壁壘在該行業也非主要因素。","comment_en":"Sanmina's business model does not rely on patents or regulatory licenses to establish a moat. As an EMS company, its core competitiveness lies in the efficiency of its manufacturing processes, quality control, and supply chain management, rather than unique technology or regulated market access. While the company may hold certain process improvements or patents, these generally do not constitute a durable and significant competitive barrier, as technology iterates rapidly and is easily imitated. Regulatory barriers are also not a primary factor in this industry."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Sanmina 的客戶轉換成本相對較高，這主要源於其在複雜電子產品製造領域的深度參與。為特定客戶定製的生產線、嚴格的質量驗證流程、供應鏈的整合以及對客戶產品技術的深入了解，都構成了客戶轉換供應商的顯著障礙。一旦客戶將關鍵生產環節外包給 Sanmina，重新驗證和整合新供應商將耗費大量時間、資源和潛在的生產風險，從而鎖定現有客戶關係。","comment_en":"Sanmina's customer switching costs are relatively high, primarily due to its deep involvement in the manufacturing of complex electronic products. Customized production lines for specific clients, stringent quality validation processes, supply chain integration, and in-depth understanding of client product technologies all constitute significant obstacles for customers switching suppliers. Once a customer outsources critical production processes to Sanmina, re-validating and integrating a new supplier would consume substantial time, resources, and potentially incur production risks, thereby locking in existing customer relationships."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Sanmina 的業務模式幾乎不存在網絡效應。作為一家電子製造服務提供商，其價值主要體現在為單一客戶提供高效、可靠的製造服務，而非通過用戶之間的互動來增加價值。公司與供應商和客戶的關係是交易性的，並非基於網絡效應的增長模式。因此，該維度對 Sanmina 的護城河貢獻甚微。","comment_en":"Sanmina's business model exhibits virtually no network effects. As an Electronic Manufacturing Services (EMS) provider, its value is primarily derived from offering efficient and reliable manufacturing services to individual clients, rather than increasing value through interactions among users. The company's relationships with suppliers and customers are transactional, not based on a growth model driven by network effects. Therefore, this dimension contributes minimally to Sanmina's moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Sanmina 作為全球領先的 EMS 廠商之一，其規模經濟效應顯著。龐大的生產規模、全球化的佈局以及與供應商的長期合作關係，使其能夠在採購原材料、零部件以及優化生產流程方面獲得成本優勢。這種規模帶來的成本效益，使得新進入者或規模較小的競爭對手難以在價格上與之匹敵，構成了堅實的成本壁壘。","comment_en":"As one of the world's leading EMS manufacturers, Sanmina benefits significantly from economies of scale. Its vast production volume, global footprint, and long-term relationships with suppliers enable it to achieve cost advantages in procuring raw materials, components, and optimizing production processes. This scale-driven cost efficiency makes it difficult for new entrants or smaller competitors to match its pricing, forming a solid cost barrier."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"Sanmina 在全球範圍內擁有廣泛的生產基地和供應鏈網絡，這使其能夠靈活地響應不同地區客戶的需求，並在一定程度上分散地緣政治風險。然而，這些地理資產本身並不構成獨特的、難以複製的壁壘，因為其他大型 EMS 廠商也擁有類似的全球佈局。其價值更多體現在運營效率和供應鏈韌性上，而非絕對的壟斷性。","comment_en":"Sanmina possesses extensive manufacturing facilities and supply chain networks globally, allowing it to flexibly respond to the needs of customers in different regions and to some extent diversify geopolitical risks. However, these geographic assets themselves do not constitute unique, irreplicable barriers, as other large EMS manufacturers also have similar global footprints. Their value is more reflected in operational efficiency and supply chain resilience rather than absolute monopolistic advantage."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Sanmina 在運營效率方面表現出色，這是其作為頂級 EMS 廠商的核心競爭力之一。公司持續優化生產流程、實施精益製造、嚴格的質量控制以及高效的供應鏈管理，確保了產品的按時交付和高良率。這種卓越的運營能力不僅降低了成本，也提升了客戶滿意度和忠誠度，構成了難以被輕易模仿的壁壘。","comment_en":"Sanmina excels in operational efficiency, which is one of its core competitive strengths as a top-tier EMS provider. The company continuously optimizes production processes, implements lean manufacturing, maintains strict quality control, and manages its supply chain efficiently, ensuring on-time delivery and high yield rates. This operational excellence not only reduces costs but also enhances customer satisfaction and loyalty, forming a barrier that is difficult to replicate easily."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Sanmina 的管理層在資本配置方面展現出穩健的策略。公司歷史上通過審慎的併購擴張業務，同時也注重通過股票回購和股息向股東返還價值。其對研發和產能投資的權衡，以及對現金流的有效管理，顯示出其在追求長期增長和股東回報之間取得平衡的能力。儘管非頂尖水平，但其資本配置決策對維持和增強公司競爭力起到了積極作用。","comment_en":"Sanmina's management demonstrates a sound strategy in capital allocation. Historically, the company has expanded its business through prudent acquisitions while also focusing on returning value to shareholders via share buybacks and dividends. Its balancing of investments in R&D and production capacity, along with effective cash flow management, shows its ability to strike a balance between pursuing long-term growth and shareholder returns. While not at the absolute top tier, its capital allocation decisions have played a positive role in maintaining and enhancing the company's competitiveness."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Sanmina 在客戶保留方面表現穩健，這得益於其在複雜製造領域的專業能力和長期建立的合作關係。一旦客戶將關鍵的、技術複雜的生產環節委託給 Sanmina，由於轉換成本高昂（如前述），客戶通常會維持長期的合作關係。公司與主要客戶之間的緊密整合和協同效應，進一步鞏固了客戶忠誠度，形成了較強的客戶保留壁壘。","comment_en":"Sanmina exhibits strong customer retention, stemming from its expertise in complex manufacturing and long-established partnerships. Once customers entrust Sanmina with critical, technologically complex production segments, the high switching costs (as mentioned previously) typically lead to long-term cooperative relationships. The close integration and synergy between the company and its major clients further solidify customer loyalty, forming a robust barrier to customer attrition."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Sanmina 的業務模式具有一定的持久性，但面臨來自技術快速變革和市場競爭的挑戰。作為 EMS 行業的一員，其核心競爭力在於適應性強的製造能力和供應鏈管理，這使其能夠在不斷變化的市場中生存。然而，該行業的技術更新速度快，客戶需求多樣化，以及來自亞洲低成本製造商的競爭壓力，都對其長期競爭優勢的持久性構成考驗。其持久性更多依賴於持續的運營優化和客戶關係維護。","comment_en":"Sanmina's business model possesses a degree of durability, but it faces challenges from rapid technological change and market competition. As a member of the EMS industry, its core competitiveness lies in its adaptable manufacturing capabilities and supply chain management, enabling it to survive in a constantly evolving market. However, the industry's rapid technological advancements, diverse customer demands, and competitive pressure from low-cost Asian manufacturers test the longevity of its competitive advantages. Its durability relies more on continuous operational optimization and customer relationship maintenance."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Sanmina 的護城河主要建立在其規模經濟帶來的成本優勢（M5）和卓越的運營效率（M7）之上，這使其在電子製造服務（EMS）領域具有顯著的競爭力。客戶因高轉換成本（M3）而傾向於維持長期合作關係（M9），進一步鞏固了公司的市場地位。然而，Sanmina 的業務模式缺乏專利（M2）和網絡效應（M4）等強大壁壘，品牌定價權（M1）也相對有限。其護城河屬於「收費橋」類型，依賴於高效的運營和規模來吸引並留住客戶，但面對快速的技術變革，其持久性（M10）有待觀察。總體而言，Sanmina 擁有堅固但非無懈可擊的護城河。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Sanmina's moat is primarily built upon its cost advantages derived from economies of scale (M5) and excellent operational efficiency (M7), granting it significant competitiveness in the Electronic Manufacturing Services (EMS) sector. High switching costs (M3) encourage customers to maintain long-term relationships (M9), further solidifying the company's market position. However, Sanmina's business model lacks strong barriers such as patents (M2) and network effects (M4), and its brand pricing power (M1) is relatively limited. Its moat is akin to a 'toll bridge,' relying on efficient operations and scale to attract and retain customers, but its durability (M10) faces scrutiny amidst rapid technological changes. Overall, Sanmina possesses a solid, though not impenetrable, moat.","evidenceHash":"d7daaf0fd03c09b06d2855d11321ce973e3a8f593486af09fcbbd4e7adc30ea7","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"d7daaf0fd03c09b06d2855d11321ce973e3a8f593486af09fcbbd4e7adc30ea7","currentEvidenceHash":"d7daaf0fd03c09b06d2855d11321ce973e3a8f593486af09fcbbd4e7adc30ea7"},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-09-27","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T13:00:26.115Z","evidenceHash":"e579e05e8afc883d6bf01cde00f4c0c9b331bc284e1e2130d7fc577cb7ce17f8"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-09-27","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T13:00:26.115Z","evidenceHash":"e579e05e8afc883d6bf01cde00f4c0c9b331bc284e1e2130d7fc577cb7ce17f8"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SANM.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SANM.png","website":"https://www.sanmina.com","ceo":"Jure Sola","full_time_employees":"35000","description":"Sanmina Corporation delivers comprehensive manufacturing services, encompassing components, finished goods, repair, supply chain management, and post-sale support on a global scale. Its operations are structured into two principal divisions: Integrated Manufacturing Solutions, and Components, Products and Services. The company's extensive service portfolio includes product ideation and engineering – from initial concept development and detailed design to prototyping, validation, pre-production, manufacturing readiness, and ultimate product industrialization. Furthermore, Sanmina provides assembly and testing, direct order shipping and logistics, post-market product maintenance and assistance, and end-to-end supply chain oversight. It also undertakes the production of individual components, subassemblies, and complete systems. Beyond these services, Sanmina offers a range of specialized products like interconnect systems (e.g., printed circuit boards, backplanes, cable assemblies, plastic injection molded parts), mechanical systems (such as custom enclosures and precision-machined components), advanced solutions in memory, storage, radio frequency, optics, and microelectronics, along with defense and aerospace-specific items, and cloud-enabled manufacturing execution software. The company primarily caters to original equipment manufacturers across diverse sectors, including industrial, healthcare, defense and aviation, automotive, telecommunications, and cloud computing. Established in 1980, Sanmina Corporation maintains its corporate headquarters in San Jose, California.","description_en":"Sanmina Corporation delivers comprehensive manufacturing services, encompassing components, finished goods, repair, supply chain management, and post-sale support on a global scale. Its operations are structured into two principal divisions: Integrated Manufacturing Solutions, and Components, Products and Services. The company's extensive service portfolio includes product ideation and engineering – from initial concept development and detailed design to prototyping, validation, pre-production, manufacturing readiness, and ultimate product industrialization. Furthermore, Sanmina provides assembly and testing, direct order shipping and logistics, post-market product maintenance and assistance, and end-to-end supply chain oversight. It also undertakes the production of individual components, subassemblies, and complete systems. Beyond these services, Sanmina offers a range of specialized products like interconnect systems (e.g., printed circuit boards, backplanes, cable assemblies, plastic injection molded parts), mechanical systems (such as custom enclosures and precision-machined components), advanced solutions in memory, storage, radio frequency, optics, and microelectronics, along with defense and aerospace-specific items, and cloud-enabled manufacturing execution software. The company primarily caters to original equipment manufacturers across diverse sectors, including industrial, healthcare, defense and aviation, automotive, telecommunications, and cloud computing. Established in 1980, Sanmina Corporation maintains its corporate headquarters in San Jose, California.","description_zh":"Sanmina Corporation（美股代碼：SANM）為 Technology 領域之重要企業，專注於 Hardware, Equipment & Parts 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"2700 North First Street","city":"San Jose","state":"CA","zip":"95134","country":"US","phone":"408 964 3500","full_ad